{"3787120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "W.I.M.S. - Where is my ship?!", "steam_appid": 3787120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>W.I.M.S. - Where is my ship?!</strong> is a precision platformer in an open world with multiple areas and many ways to play the game. Find collectables, upgrade your character and try to keep calm. Failing is part of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Blueprints to build your ship and escape.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras/71a4826bdbe80f349706ec42ad8e5808.poster.avif?t=1787752009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras/71a4826bdbe80f349706ec42ad8e5808.webm?t=1787752009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras/71a4826bdbe80f349706ec42ad8e5808.mp4?t=1787752009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find coins to upgrade your character in strength and in style. Jump to places not reachable before or just look good. Or both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras/bd345ac1eb396047d13cfe2d939f04c2.poster.avif?t=1787752009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras/bd345ac1eb396047d13cfe2d939f04c2.webm?t=1787752009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras/bd345ac1eb396047d13cfe2d939f04c2.mp4?t=1787752009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new Areas in an open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE FOREST</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras/f0ae8225ceca4c3ce5f011ccd2d89917.avif?t=1787752009\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras_big/f0ae8225ceca4c3ce5f011ccd2d89917.webp?t=1787752009 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE OVEN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras/a662a167f66cdf8ff49b66c09ff9e1d4.avif?t=1787752009\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras_big/a662a167f66cdf8ff49b66c09ff9e1d4.webp?t=1787752009 width=1560 height=911 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE CHURCH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras/5127e8c282a9b4110c534e1d78314c4e.avif?t=1787752009\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras_big/5127e8c282a9b4110c534e1d78314c4e.webp?t=1787752009 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in different ways to make it more challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras/cc8db73f1f2b93a8af594b22d943306e.avif?t=1787752009\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras_big/cc8db73f1f2b93a8af594b22d943306e.webp?t=1787752009 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>W.I.M.S. - Where is my ship?!</strong> is a precision platformer in an open world with multiple areas and many ways to play the game. Find collectables, upgrade your character and try to keep calm. Failing is part of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Blueprints to build your ship and escape.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras/71a4826bdbe80f349706ec42ad8e5808.poster.avif?t=1787752009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras/71a4826bdbe80f349706ec42ad8e5808.webm?t=1787752009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras/71a4826bdbe80f349706ec42ad8e5808.mp4?t=1787752009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find coins to upgrade your character in strength and in style. Jump to places not reachable before or just look good. Or both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras/bd345ac1eb396047d13cfe2d939f04c2.poster.avif?t=1787752009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras/bd345ac1eb396047d13cfe2d939f04c2.webm?t=1787752009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras/bd345ac1eb396047d13cfe2d939f04c2.mp4?t=1787752009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new Areas in an open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE FOREST</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras/f0ae8225ceca4c3ce5f011ccd2d89917.avif?t=1787752009\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras_big/f0ae8225ceca4c3ce5f011ccd2d89917.webp?t=1787752009 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE OVEN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras/a662a167f66cdf8ff49b66c09ff9e1d4.avif?t=1787752009\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras_big/a662a167f66cdf8ff49b66c09ff9e1d4.webp?t=1787752009 width=1560 height=911 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE CHURCH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras/5127e8c282a9b4110c534e1d78314c4e.avif?t=1787752009\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras_big/5127e8c282a9b4110c534e1d78314c4e.webp?t=1787752009 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in different ways to make it more challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras/cc8db73f1f2b93a8af594b22d943306e.avif?t=1787752009\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/extras_big/cc8db73f1f2b93a8af594b22d943306e.webp?t=1787752009 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "&quot;W.I.M.S. - Where is my ship?!&quot; is a Precision Platformer playable in first and third Person with an open world to play the way you want to play. Unlock Upgrades and Cosmetics and find the Blueprints in the world to build your ship to return home.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/cc22d42f3ee246d8b3d69ddeabcfcd7f7e9bec20/header.jpg?t=1787752009", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/27b7f7c1f10cdc2940a49d256bc84c70bbb12e78/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787752009", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787120/27b7f7c1f10cdc2940a49d256bc84c70bbb12e78/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787752009", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-12100 , Ryzen 3 3300X or equal<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 Super or equal<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> I am not 100% sure about the Processor and Graphics because i was not able to test it with options. This is an estimate.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["JanotherT"], "publishers": ["JanotherT"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 699, "final": 699, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$6.99"}, "packages": [1332269], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy W.I.M.S. - Where is my ship?!", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "s